<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Sept 26.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Cido Star 120,000 long tons coal Port Kembla 20-30/10 $4.30 35,000/40,000 China Steel.</p>
<p>IRON ORE - Daiko Maru 150,000 long tons iron ore Ubu/Fos 20/10-5/11 $5.35 six days shinc Hanjin.</p>
<p>Viva 110,000 long tons iron ore Narvick/Antwerp 20-30/10 $3.90 50,000/35,000 Cobelfret.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
